<title>POLAND: Exbud signs $19.2 mln Czech contract.</title>
<headline>Exbud signs $19.2 mln Czech contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Exbud SA has signed a contract worth $19.2 million with a Czech firm, Czech-Ogden Airhandling sro, Exbud said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The company did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
